- **q10 cancel redesign** (`58000a4`) — cancel checked at q21 gate (honest block) not silent runner abort; DELETE /vgen/cancel + "Clear block" banner button. Root cause confirmed live: a stale `app_config vgen_cancel:<ep>` token (Director clicked Cancel at 06:07) silently aborted every manual render (`kind:cancelled`). Cleared it; renders unblocked.
