- **Worktree cleanup** — removed 18 dead worktrees + pruned merged branches; salvaged the naming-validator studio-dir whitelist (`36f0445`) from a998b0b.
- **Verify trio all green at each step**: tsc 0 · 873 tests · replay-pilot 30/30.

