## Decisions Made

- **q21 not stricter than the runner** — provider-unknown + duration-out-of-range are WARNINGS not blockers (runner soft-falls-back / clamps), so the gate can't false-block a render the runner would complete.
- **q10 cancel = honest gate block, run-scoped, with a visible OFF** — not a silent sticky episode lock. Deliberate regenerate bypass reverted in favour of the gate owning the deliberate path.
- **One shared `ActivityEventRow`** — killed 3× duplicated row markup (anti-additivity). Feed row = `WHO · action · verdict · reltime · abstime`, governance boilerplate in a chevron drawer.
- **Polina-proxy detected via `[Prod Assistant]` text marker** (brittle) — honest metadata field deferred to concierge layer.
- **Committed the neighbour's `factory.ts`** carefully (Director said "сосед стоит") — only that file staged.

